cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "A11yJourney Compose: accessible-by-default Jetpack Compose components"
abstract: >-
  Jetpack Compose components for Android with accessibility guarantees built
  in or enforced (required labels, 48dp targets, errors in words, input
  purpose, large-text layouts, session timeout warnings, radio-group time
  slots, spoken transit arrivals, status messages, and captioned video),
  mapped to WCAG 2.1 Level AA, with a demo app audited in CI by A11yJourney.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Sunny
    family-names: Mehta
    email: sunnykmehta@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/mehtasunny/a11yjourney-compose"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - accessibility
  - android
  - jetpack compose
  - wcag
  - screen reader
  - low vision
